Ashmont is a professor at the Arcanum of [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]] who researches what he calls [[Phenomena/The Wick|the Wick]]. On [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]]'s job through [[People/Althane/Oxas|Oxas]], [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] stole his research and his key to the Arcanum's annex.
